<title>UK: AHB sets 500 million mark FRN due 2007.</title>
<headline>AHB sets 500 million mark FRN due 2007.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLGEMEINE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    02.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    02.APR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/=     ISS PRICE  100.19    FULL FEES   0.20</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) 10	  GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 480</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
